    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Very attractive bedroom detached residence presented in turn key condition and  ideally positioned in a mature location. This home offers generous well balanced accommodation perfect for modern family living. The ground floor offers 2 reception rooms and a kitchen diningroom providing excellent flexibility for both relaxing and entertaining. Upstairs there are three bedrooms each offering comfortable living space along with a family bathroom. The layout is both practical and and making it easy to adapt to a variety of lifestyle needs. Located in an established neighbourhood with mature surroundings and its convenience to local amenities ,schools and transport links all within easy reach.0876726255"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Floor plan attached"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Avondale Drive is a highly sought after estate within walking distance of all town amenities including Athy Train Station, making it an ideal property for investors or commuters alike. It also boasts the benefit of close proximity to the Athy distributor road giving quick access to the link road to the N9. 0876726255\r\n\r\nThese particulars are issued by JosephMcDonnell Estate Agents on the understanding that any negotiations respecting the property\r\nmentioned are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars, but the agents do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracy in the particulars and terms of the property referred to, or for any expense that may be incurred in visiting same, should it prove unsuitable or have been let, sold, or withdrawn. Applicants are advised to make an appointment through us before viewing and are respectfully requested to report their opinion after inspection. Should the above not be suitable please let us know your exact requirements. Any reasonable offer will be submitted to the owner for consideration. Joseph McDonnell Estate Agents 2021. PSRA Reg No. 001383."
      },
